<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079167/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079168" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Viro Doctissimo at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> Celeberrimo
      <lb/>Petro Antonio <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Joh.</abbr><expan>Johannes</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs>.</salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Respondissem citius ad ultimas Tuas <rs key="B_991170515150805501" type="letter">litteras</rs>
      <lb/>gratissimas, nisi in iisdem mihi spem
      <lb/>fecisses, Te mihi intra mensem iterum
      <lb/>scripturum ad faciendum me certiorem,
      <lb/>quid de itinere, quod meditaris in <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Galliam</rs>
      <lb/>cum <choice><abbr>Illustr.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimo</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell.</abbr><expan>Excellentissimo</expan></choice> Equite Laurentio
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">Theupolo</rs> apud Te deliberaveris et statueris;
      <lb/>Quia autem hactenus nil litterarum abs
      <lb/>Te accepi, nolu<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice> diutius differre responsionem;
      <lb/>Mihi sane gratissimum foret, si Te
      <lb/>in reditu Tuo ex <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Galliis</rs> per hanc urbem
      <lb/>iter facientem deosculari et amplexari possem;
      <lb/>Hoc tantum enixe rogo, ut recta ad me
      <lb/>divertas at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> Hospitio et mensa mea (etsi tenui)
<pb facs="1079169" n="2"/>
      <lb/>fruaris per aliquod tempus; fortassis <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> meus,
      <lb/>qui Te officiose salutat et qui nuper duxit <rs key="pers_DE-588-1216205728" type="person">uxorem</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG"><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolaus I Bernoulli</rs> heiratete am 3. Juni 1720 <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1216205728">Anna Maria Birr</rs> (1681–1747). <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117589144">Nicolaus II Bernoulli</rs> gratulierte ihm dazu in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517063405501">Brief</rs> vom 14. Juni 1720 (p. 1).</note>
      <lb/>valde opulentam eundem honorem Tui pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentia
      <lb/>in <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dibus suis gaudendi expetet; saltem alteruter nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#uhat">û</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m
      <lb/>isthoc honoris pro certo sperabit. Quando apud Nos
      <lb/>fueris deliberabimus, num e re sit <rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">filium</rs> meum
      <lb/>secundum Tecum in <rs key="place_KON-italie" type="place">Italiam</rs> mittere, interim
      <lb/>absolvet cursum suum Medicum at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> suam
      <lb/>habebit <rs key="biblio_KGZSMV2E" type="biblio">Dissertationem</rs> inauguralem, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> forte
      <lb/>tractabit de Respiratione; gratias vero debitas
      <lb/>ago pro cubili quod ipsi offers, nec non pro li<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>centi<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>, quam ipsi concedis <choice><orig><g ref="#AE">Æ</g></orig><reg>Ae</reg></choice>gros Tuos Tecum
      <lb/>visitandi, ut in praxi Medica sese exercere
      <lb/>possit. Gaudeo quod annotationes me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in
      <lb/>Elegantem Tuam <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertationem</rs> Tibi haud displi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cuerint. Scire aveo an perinde placuerint, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>in <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurinum</rs>, <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilium</rs>, et, ni fallor, adhuc in
      <lb/>alium quendam co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>enti sumus; si co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>ode Tuo
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">operi</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti berichtet in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515150605501">Brief</rs> vom 18. Juli 1720 (pp. 1–2), er habe Bernoullis Anmerkungen zu James Keill und James Jurin in seine Dissertation aufgenommen, insbesondere die zur Geschwindigkeit, mit der Wasser aus einem Gefäss ausfliesst.</note> inseri possunt, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sertim qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ad velocitatem
      <lb/>aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ex vase effluentis spectant mihi pergratum
<pb facs="1079170" n="3"/>
         erit; Ne <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurinus</rs> et alii qui cum eo faciunt
      <lb/>Angli de Nobis tanquam victis triumphum
      <lb/>canant. Spero pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>laudatum Tuum <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">opus</rs> posse
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>lum evadere, antequam iter Tuum <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Gallic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>aggrediaris, ita ut aliquod ejus exemplar in reditu
      <lb/>Tuo, ubi hac transieris, mihi a<subst><del>p</del><add>s</add></subst>portari<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Bernoulli hofft, dass Michelotti ihm auf der Rückreise ein Exemplar mitbringen kann.</note>  possis.
      <lb/>Quod superest, rogo, ut <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">filium</rs> meum, cui adjectas
      <lb/><rs type="letter">litteras</rs> tradi cures, Tibi semper commendatum
      <lb/>habeas.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir Celeberrime et mihi favere
      <lb/>perge.</salute><dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1720-07-06">VI<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> Julii 1720.</date></dateline></closer>
<pb facs="1079171" n="4" type="empty"/>
</div></body></text></TEI>